ct Membership or Pack; if you will not initially attend group classes, select Therapy."},"signup.text.familyGroupIntro":{"ca":"Si a casa ja hi ha algú abonat, podeu formar un grup familiar amb un únic responsable del pagament: la quota mensual es redueix a partir del segon gos. Així, per dos gossos la quota mensual seria de {twoDogsMonthlyFee}. L'entrada sí que és per cada gos.","es":"Si en casa ya hay alguien abonado, podéis formar un grupo familiar con un único responsable del pago: la cuota mensual se reduce a partir del segundo perro. Así, para dos perros la cuota mensual sería de {twoDogsMonthlyFee}. La matrícula sí es por cada perro.","en":"If someone in your household is already a member, you can form a family group with one person responsible for payment: the monthly fee is reduced from the second dog. For two dogs, the monthly fee would be {twoDogsMonthlyFee}. The joining fee still applies to each dog."},"signup.rateLimit":{"identityChecksPerHour":10,"familyGroupLookupsPerHour":20,"uploadUrlsPerHour":30,"signupPerHour":5,"signupPerDay":20,"checkoutSessionsAnonymousPerHour":10,"townsPerHour":60,"notificationsPerRecipientPerHour":3},"activities.cancelDeadline":"EVENT_START","activities.publicUrlTemplate":"{websiteUrl}/activitat/{slug}","bookings.paymentPendingMinutes":30,"ringBlocks.maxHorizonDays":60,"attendance.editDays":1,"files.maxAttachmentsPerEntity":10,"messaging.sms.transliterateToGsm7":true,"messaging.push.ttlMinutes":1440,"billing.invoiceSeriesPattern":"{YYYY}","billing.invoiceResetYearly":true,"billing.cashInvoicing":"SEMESTER","billing.upfrontCutoffDay":25,"billing.packToMemberEntryDiscountPercent":40,"billing.packToMemberMinSessions":10,"billing.taxIncluded":true,"billing.sepa.useFrst":false,"billing.sepa.schema":"pain.008.001.02","billing.sepa.collectionDayOfMonth":1,"billing.stripeMaxAttempts":3,"billing.remittanceReminderDay":22,"inactivity.maxStartMonthsAhead":12,"leave.packExpiryGraceDays":30,"audit.retentionYears":6,"rgpd.erasureMinDaysAfte